      "input_id": "gnews:fbce0469dbb5b33e2c34a0f5",
      "facts": [
        {
          "quote": "A VideoCardz source confirmed that one board partner already has RTX 50 Super GPUs on hand, but Nvidia has allegedly told the company that the products are on hold because of the price of 3GB GDDR7 memory chips. ... these chips cost twice or thrice as much as their 2GB variants",
          "meaning": "据 VideoCardz 消息人士，至少一家板卡伙伴已有 RTX 50 Super 产品，但 NVIDIA 据称因 3GB GDDR7 价格而暂停推出。文章称该颗粒价格为 2GB 版本的两至三倍；报道并非 NVIDIA 的正式发布声明。",
          "weight": "core",
          "pages": ["v19"],
          "why": "这是上市时点和定价的直接风险信号，但匿名消息不能证明产品必然延期至问题期限之后。"
        },
        {
          "quote": "Nvidia used to supply VRAM chips alongside GPU dies to its board partners, but it changed this policy in late 2025 as the memory chip crisis unfolded. Because of this, the companies that complete the final assembly of the graphics cards are forced to source their own memory chips in an increasingly competitive market.",
          "meaning": "文章称 NVIDIA 于 2025 年底改变显存供应政策，板卡伙伴须自行采购显存。",
          "weight": "colour",
          "pages": ["v19"],
          "why": "虽是较早的政策变化，但它解释了为何显存成本和供应会约束伙伴生产及 Super 系列推出，不能简单视为 NVIDIA 自身承担全部显存成本。"
        },
        {
          "quote": "Its latest AI systems are now more expensive than ever, with memory accounting for 25% of the BOM, as costs have soared by nearly 500%.",
          "meaning": "文章称 NVIDIA 最新 AI 系统的物料成本中显存占 25%，并称成本上涨近 500%；未给出具体系统、数据来源或涨幅基准，涨幅口径亦不清楚。",
          "weight": "colour",
          "pages": ["v6"],
          "why": "若估计可靠，内存成本可能影响 AI 系统经济性和毛利；但缺乏产品、时间和提价信息，不能据此计算公司毛利变化。"
        }
      ],
      "excluded": "未将内部发布日期、具体零售价或延期后的上市时间作为已证实事实；文章对这些内容多为推断，读者评论亦非业务证据。"
    },
    {
      "input_id": "gnews:55b3b854d30ecb73679c2088",
      "facts": [
        {
          "quote": "Bank of America Research sees the server CPU total addressable market reaching $170 billion by 2030, roughly four times current levels",
          "meaning": "美国银行研究部预计服务器 CPU 总可服务市场到 2030 年达 1,700 亿美元，约为当前四倍。这是长期市场预测，不是 NVIDIA 收入预测。",
          "weight": "colour",
          "pages": [],
          "why": "反映 NVIDIA 进入服务器 CPU 市场的潜在机会；文章未提供预测方法、NVIDIA 份额或 FY2027 独立 CPU 收入。"
        },
        {
          "quote": "AMD estimates its EPYC 9965 (Turin) chip delivers approximately 2.4x the rack-level throughput of NVIDIA's Vera baseline in a modeled 100kW deployment, with the next-generation EPYC 6 (Venice) projected to extend that advantage to roughly 3.3x total throughput",
          "meaning": "按美国银行转述的 AMD 自身模型，在 100kW 机柜配置下，现有 EPYC 9965 吞吐量约为 Vera 基准的 2.4 倍；AMD 预计下一代 EPYC 6 可达约 3.3 倍。",
          "weight": "core",
          "pages": ["v7"],
          "why": "直接关系 Vera 的服务器 CPU 竞争力。但这是竞争对手的建模及预测，并非独立实测；吞吐量也不能单独决定延迟、GPU 利用率或客户采用。"
        },
        {
          "quote": "AMD and Intel both carry the weight of x86's installed base in enterprise environments, a structural advantage that BofA flags as potentially decisive as AI moves beyond model inference.",
          "meaning": "美国银行认为企业 x86 软件存量可能有利于 AMD 和 Intel，并构成 ARM 架构 Vera 的长期采用风险。",
          "weight": "colour",
          "pages": ["v7"],
          "why": "软件迁移和现有部署会影响企业 CPU 采购，不仅取决于硬件跑分；文章未证明具体客户放弃 Vera。"
        }
      ],
      "excluded": "未把 Vera 架构介绍当作 Vera Rubin 平台已开始采样或交付的证据；买入评级、目标价和未具经济规模的规格不单独记录。"
    },
